<title>FRANCE: Paris bourse opening delayed - SBF.</title>
<headline>Paris bourse opening delayed - SBF.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Paris bourse opening will be delayed due to technical problems, the SBF French stockmarkets association said on Friday.</p>
<p>It gave no time for the delayed opening. The market normally officially opens at 0800 GMT.</p>
</text>
